BEGIN IMMEDIATE;

-- v0.30 continues the fault-isolated global story-expansion ledger with a
-- second batch. The two v0.28 queued targets (Nüwa and the Indian churning
-- texts) are now registered as independent textual witnesses. Every witness
-- keeps its own locator; NOT_STATED is never converted into a negative claim,
-- later retellings are not back-projected, and no textual witness is used to
-- decide the recension of the Angkor Wat relief.

