('source.china.huainanzi.tianwenxun.ctext','Huainanzi, Tian Wen Xun','淮南子·天文訓','PRIMARY_TEXT_DIGITAL_EDITION',2,'Chinese Text Project','Compiled under Liu An; received-text digital edition by Chinese Text Project','lang.lzh',NULL,'2026-10-02','https://ctext.org/huainanzi/tian-wen-xun','urn:ctp:huainanzi/tian-wen-xun','ctp:huainanzi/tian-wen-xun','Site terms apply; ancient text is public-domain cultural heritage','Received Western Han compendium chapter in a scholarly digital library',NULL,'Digital scholarly library',0,'No bulk copying; cite the chapter page, verify edition metadata and publish independent summaries only.',0,'Classical Chinese with digital alignment','URL_SYNTAX_VALID','Chapter page for the Gonggong and Mount Buzhou passage. The URL follows the CTP Huainanzi chapter pattern confirmed for neighbouring chapters; the page itself was not fetched from the build environment.'),
