('claim.v0300.gonggong.tianwen_standalone','text.chinese.huainanzi.tianwen_gonggong_passage','PRESENTS_SEQUENCE',NULL,'Gonggong''s collision as a standalone cosmological etiology; Nüwa is not named in this passage.','STRING','The Huainanzi Tian Wen witness narrates the Gonggong collision on its own as an explanation of cosmic orientation without naming Nüwa.','v0300.china.gonggong.placement','SUPPORTED',0.94,'HIGH','VERIFIED','TEXT_SAYS','TEXTUAL_WITNESS','Huainanzi Tian Wen witness',NULL,'Not stated is recorded as scope, not as a denial.','2026-10-02T05:40:00Z'),
