('claim.v0300.churn.kurma_supports','deity.hindu.kurma','SUPPORTS','place.hindu.mandara',NULL,NULL,'In the Bhāgavata Purāṇa witness Viṣṇu, in the form of a giant tortoise, raises Mount Mandara on his back.','v0300.india.churning.tortoise_support','SUPPORTED',0.95,'HIGH','VERIFIED','TEXT_SAYS','MYTHIC_NARRATIVE','Bhāgavata Purāṇa witness',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-02T05:40:00Z'),
