('claim.v0300.churn.mbh_poison_scope','event.hindu.samudra_manthana','EVIDENCE_SCOPE',NULL,'The constituted critical text at Ādiparvan 1.15–1.17 does not narrate Śiva swallowing the poison; manuscript-apparatus and regional versions are not assessed here.','STRING','The poison-swallowing episode is NOT_STATED at this critical-edition locator; this records the scope of one scholarly witness and is not evidence of absence from every manuscript or tradition.','v0300.india.churning.poison','SUPPORTED',0.86,'MEDIUM','VERIFIED','TEXT_SAYS','TEXTUAL_WITNESS','Mahābhārata critical edition',NULL,'Critical apparatus and appendix passages are queued for separate audit.','2026-10-02T05:40:00Z'),
