('claim.v0300.churn.relief_recension_boundary','event.khmer.angkor_wat_churning_scene','SOURCE_LAYER_BOUNDARY',NULL,'The v0.30 Mahābhārata and Bhāgavata Purāṇa witnesses are registered separately; neither determines the Angkor Wat relief''s textual recension.','STRING','The Angkor Wat relief remains a Khmer material witness; the newly registered Indian textual witnesses are cross-referenced but not used to decide which recension, if any, the relief follows.','v0300.india.churning.relief_boundary','INTERPRETIVE',0.98,'HIGH','VERIFIED','SCHOLARLY_INTERPRETATION','SCHOLARLY_INTERPRETATION','Material and textual witness boundary',NULL,'Southeast Asian textual and epigraphic witnesses remain queued.','2026-10-02T05:40:00Z');

